  <iati-identifier>GB-1-205118-415</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="GB-GOV-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK - Foreign, Commonwealth Development Office (FCDO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO contribution to Aceli Africa - Increasing Access to Finance for Early-Stage Agri-Businesses in East Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will build on and help to align Aceli&#x2019;s projects with FCDO Posts in Tanzania, Uganda and Zambia. It will scale Aceli&#x2019;s activities in Kenya and Rwanda, supporting around 50 agri-SMEs with investment readiness and connecting businesses to lenders.  Aceli will also be supported to expand its incentives model to include first-time borrowers and underserved communities. Finally, Aceli will gather learning across FCDO Posts from implementation, and deliver at least one market study to inform expansion to other countries and/or replication of the model by other actors.</narrative>
  </description>
